  "releaseNotes": "* Updated to DotExtensions.Memory 9.1.0 Preview 2 from 9.0.0 (#110 )\n* Added missing ``Count``, ``Distinct``, ``Select``, and ``First`` and ``Last`` predicate methods for ``ReadOnlySpan<T>``, ``ReadOnlyMemory<T>``, and ``Memory<T>`` ( #108)\n* Added Immediate mode method ``DistinctBy`` LINQ style extensions\n* Add ElementsAtOrDefault and ElementsAt for Memory package (#107 ) \n* Enabled code path in Span<T> ``GetRange`` method previously only accessible to .NET 8+ due to .NET Standard 2 backport of ``IsIncrementedRange`` in DotExtensions\n* Enabled Argument Exception style ThrowIfX Polyfill methods, using Polyfill 9.3.0, for .NET Standard 2.0",
